						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														&lt;Mezicus sees land far off in the distance and begins to paddle rapidly&gt;          <br />
<br />
Hello friends, Evantha and I bid you all a good day.  It is looking like the end is near, so  sometime in the not so distant future we shall be returning.  Please try to keep your applause to a minimum.  I am looking forward to meeting all of you that have joined in my absence, and hopefully I will have the opportunity to work with some of you.  I know that I am way behind the power curve as far as character advancement, but I plan to put in some work to make up for lost time.  Regretfully I must go, but I hope to hear from you all soon.<br />
<br />
&lt;Mezicus goes to wake up Evantha to paddle the rest of the way but falls asleep.  Poor little gnome, will he ever be able to stay awake?!&gt;						</td>
