					<div class="xsmall">5/16/2003 - 5:05 PM PST</div>
					<hr width="75%" align="left">
					<div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=5221">Naceris Se'rein</a></div>					
					<br>
				</td>
				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														Well it's about time!  I've been needing some things tinkered you little freak of a humanoid!						</td>
					</tr>
