				</td>
			</tr>
						<tr>
				<td width="30%" class="body" valign="top">
					<b><div class="smallbody"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/user/view_user.php?id=5891">Mezicus</a></div></b>
					<div class="xsmall">5/24/2003 - 10:00 AM PST</div>
					<hr width="75%" align="left">
					<div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=4798">Mezicus Durmiente</a></div>					
					<br>
				</td>
				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														I am way behind on my tinkering, but if i can come by some loot i am going to try to up my skill a bit.  What kinda things are you looking to aquire?  Right now about the only thing i can make is fireworks, but they are great for parties and sometimes they pull quite a profit.  And who are you calling a freak, you dirty darkling?!  Anyways, i am sure we will have time to become aquanted here in the near future.  As for the rest of you, Evantha and i will be home soon and then you can harass us all you want.  Mazith, i know you will be making up for lost time.  Keep helping Eva, cuz she is lazy and never plays and i am going to be needing a partner.						</td>
					</tr>
